OL,3,ANHS, schools and police forces hit by
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FKey services across the UK, including
OL,7,Fthe NHS, GPs and schools, have been
OL,8,Faffected by a global Microsoft outage.
OL,10,FPharmacies and businesses have also
OL,11,Fbeen hit after email and messaging
OL,12,Fservices went down.
OL,14,FNHS England said patients should still
OL,15,Fattend appointments unless told
OL,16,Fotherwise, while several large police
OL,17,Fforces are urging the public to call if
OL,18,Fthey want to report a crime.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/37
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
