OL,3,ARosenberg: Uncompromising Putin ups
OL,4,Ademands for peace with Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia's President Vladimir Putin says
OL,7,Fhe wishes "eternal peace" for Ukraine.
OL,9,FThat is the same Russian president who
OL,10,Fordered the full-scale invasion of
OL,11,FRussia's neighbour nearly five years
OL,12,Fago and who continues to reject the
OL,13,Fidea of a comprehensive ceasefire.
OL,15,FAnd what, in Moscow's view, is a
OL,16,Fprerequisite for peace?
OL,18,FThe Kremlin spelt it out after talks
OL,19,Fwith US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared
OL,20,FKushner: "A new, long-term architecture
OL,21,Fof indivisible security and peace."
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/37
