OL,3,APressure grows on Trump's Commerce
OL,4,ASecretary Lutnick in fallout from
OL,5,ANvidia scandal
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent has
OL,8,Fblamed the Commerce Department, run by
OL,9,FHoward Lutnick, for failing to properly
OL,10,Foversee the export of high-spec Nvidia
OL,11,Fchips, as the fallout from the scandal
OL,12,Fwidens.
OL,14,FThere is growing pressure on Lutnick
OL,15,Facross the political spectrum to
OL,16,Fexplain his department's actions.
OL,18,FJensen Huang was ousted as Nvidia CEO
OL,19,Fafter revelations he had an affair with
OL,20,Fa businesswoman who was also allegedly
OL,21,Fa Chinese spy.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/37
